UID:00c70ecf-80a9-5d2e-a3c8-5331c590cf75
DESCRIPTION:The Cycle Toronto Rec Hub at 401 Richmond is a welcoming commu
 nity space that takes the intimidation out of bike maintenance and repair.
 \n\nIF YOU'RE A TRAINED CYCLE TORONTO REC HUB VOLUNTEER\, SIGN UP FOR SUPP
 ORT SHIFTS.\n\nOur friendly staff and volunteers will help guide you throu
 gh the basics to keep you rolling. Even expert home mechanics are also wel
 come to use our facilities.\n\nDIY service is first come\, first serve.\n
 \nFind out more: (https://www.cycleto.ca/rec_hub) cycleto.ca/rec_hub\nURL:
  https://www.cycleto.ca/rec_hub_diy_20261210
LOCATION:Rec Hub at 401 Richmond\n550 Bayview Avenue\nToronto ON M4W 3X8\n
 CA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/rec_hub_diy_20261210
END:VEVENT
